# Safety and privacy

- Offline replay files and positively verified offline sessions only. Never automate online.
- Game input: default deny; arm + allowlist + bounds + audit; require process/foreground/integrity/offline-replay evidence.
- Never modify/redistribute WotB install or game-derived assets.
- Bot status: may be inferred from a name (player names and bot status are public Wargaming statistics).
- Never log: raw replay bytes, tokens, full paths, account IDs, chat, screenshots.
- Do not expose durable account IDs on API/UI without a clear need.
- Ignored stay ignored: private replays, captures, screenshots, DBs, logs, bundles, tool binaries.
- Major blockers → append `docs/operations/blocker-log.md` (immutable UTC; correct by append).
